    "title": "Wirecenter Assigned Planners API",
    "description": "Wirecenter Assigned Planners API<p>This API provides a mechanism to direct external teams (and systems) to the correct internal Lumen Edge planner for a given wire center CLLI code. It maintains mapping between wire center CLLI code to primary planner?s email address. Only the managers will have admin access to update this relationship.</p>",
